{"unit_id":"cckbc__dsh-session-recycle-bin#card-zh","repo":"cckbc/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"d15afde7cee07109aa744dd50ae52503c3ef7511","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recycle-bin 为 DSH 会话提供可恢复的删除与回收站。它在会话行菜单、悬停按钮和侧栏批量选择器中提供删除入口，并在设置页列出回收站内容。删除时会移动会话日志及名称缓存，支持单个或批量还原、永久删除和清空；保留期默认 15 天，也可在设置中调整。适合需要整理会话并保留误删恢复空间的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH Web 服务与连接服务；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1530-1620","client.js:3554-3599"]}
{"unit_id":"cckbc__dsh-session-recycle-bin#card-en","repo":"cckbc/dsh-session-recycle-bin","commit":"d15afde7cee07109aa744dd50ae52503c3ef7511","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Adds reversible DSH session deletion through row controls and a sidebar bulk picker. A Settings recycle-bin page supports restoring or permanently deleting entries. Logs and the name cache move into the bin; retention defaults to 15 days. Requires DSH web services; no account or API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1530-1620","client.js:3554-3599"]}
